# Refused, then updated (cavekit-site-data.md R1, T-661): Cancel saves nothing (about:logins stays empty, the form is not
# filled); a saved login submitted again with a new password asks to update it, and OK changes what is filled.
id: site-logins-refuse-update
section: Privacy and site data
item: Cancel on the remember question saves nothing; a known username with a new password asks to update, and OK changes the saved password
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true signon.rememberSignons=true signon.autofillForms=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
kit: cavekit-site-data.md R1
fixture: site-data-clean
wait rect user 30
probe refuse '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-refused","nope-1")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-cancel
expect dialog answered 8
wait line 'logins: not remembered for http://192.168.1.245:8077' 6
wait text sent "sent jihad-refused" 15
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
wait text state "user=(empty) pass=(empty)" 10
probe save '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-tester","old-pass-1")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait line 'logins: remembered for' 6
wait text sent "sent jihad-tester" 15
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
wait text state "pass=old-pass-1" 10
probe change '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-tester","new-pass-2")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait line 'logins: updated for http://192.168.1.245:8077' 6
wait text sent "sent jihad-tester" 15
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
wait text state "user=jihad-tester pass=new-pass-2" 10
launch about:logins
wait text logins "jihad-tester" 10
expect text-lacks logins "jihad-refused"
tap 'sel:#remove-all'
tap 'sel:#remove-all'
wait text logins "No logins are saved" 6
